This is such a gift. And I just wanna see how far I can take it.”

So, just how far can former Timpview High School Middle and Long Distance Runner Jane Hedengren take it at BYU? Check the books: She owns nine individual national high school records. Her greatness is the new standard.

For the most decorated and fastest distance runner in high school history, the best is yet to come.

